OL,3,GNEWSAShetland awarded #23m to develop
OL,4,Ainter-island tunnels plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FShetland has secured #23m from the
OL,7,FScottish government to fund a project
OL,8,Fto replace ageing ferries with
OL,9,Finter-island tunnels.
OL,11,FOn Wednesday, local councillors
OL,12,Fapproved a plan that could see fixed
OL,13,Flinks built between mainland Shetland,
OL,14,FYell and Unst.
OL,16,FCouncil leaders say tunnels would be a
OL,17,Fcheaper long-term alternative to new
OL,18,Fferries, but the programme could cost
OL,19,Fmore than #1bn.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
