OL,3,GNEWSAShetland awarded #23m to develop
OL,4,Ainter-island tunnels plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish government said it
OL,7,Frecognised the potential benefits of
OL,8,Ffixed links, with #23m over three years
OL,9,Ffor "pre-construction activity".
